{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-asciidoc-fields-path-tsx","path":"/interests/gaming","result":{"data":{"asciidoc":{"html":"<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"_windows\">Windows</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"_game_disappears_but_doesnt_crash_when_alt_tabbing\">Game disappears but doesn&#8217;t crash when alt-tabbing</h3>\n<div class=\"olist arabic\">\n<ol class=\"arabic\">\n<li>\n<p>Hit Windows Button.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Search (start typing) for \"Multitasking Settings\" and click it.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Under \"Virtual Desktops\" change both settings to \"All Desktops\"</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>Credit: <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/MCCPC/comments/ktqg0g/game_disappears_but_doesnt_crash_when_you_alttab/\">Game Disappears but doesn&#8217;t crash when you Alt-Tab? : MCCPC (reddit.com)</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"_teredo\">Teredo</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>Diagnosis</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-shell\" data-lang=\"shell\">netsh interface Teredo show state</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>To fix \"client is in a managed network\":</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-shell\" data-lang=\"shell\">netsh interface Teredo set state enterpriseclient</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"_games\">Games</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"_forza_horizon_4\">Forza Horizon 4</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>Fix constant disconnects:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-shell\" data-lang=\"shell\">netsh int ipv6 set teredo client teredo.trex.fi</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>Credit: <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/forza/comments/hwzl7a/for_those_having_connectivity_issues/\">For those having connectivity issues : forza (reddit.com)</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>Tuning guides:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ulist\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://atribecalledcars.com/gaming/racing-games/forza-horizon-4-tuning-guide\">Forza Horizon 4 tuning guide: Ultimate OP edition | A Tribe Called Cars</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","document":{"title":"Gaming","subtitle":"","main":"Gaming"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wei Meng's website"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"51e0fe5b-86b0-5881-9e6c-0522496d597b","fields__path":"/interests/gaming","__params":{"fields__path":"interests"}}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}